    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The Flagship&quot; is a single-player third-person space warship simulation roguelike game. From destroyers to battleships, freely choose your vessel and equip it to face node-based roguelike challenges, with each adventure offering a different experience. Your ship, equipment, skill level, and roguelike ability build will be constantly tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/72c29218a2610b41ad736a63c5030c32.avif?t=1754408163\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intense and Strategic Space Combat</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.poster.avif?t=1754408163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.webm?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.mp4?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your vessel's loadout, traits, and tactical reflexes will be tested across randomized challenges. Will you prioritize shield capacity or powerful weapons? Sacrifice engine power for more turrets?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelike Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a fresh challenge where you'll unlock unique abilities, customize your warship with upgrades, and ultimately forge a mighty vessel capable of overcoming any threat. Plus, our progression system lets you permanently boost your stats - giving you an increasing edge with each new attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Space Warship Simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.poster.avif?t=1754408163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.webm?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.mp4?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This isn't dogfighting in some tin-can starfighter \u2013 you're commanding capital-class firepower.</i>\u00a0 Unlock warship classes that redefine combat: refitted battleships enhanced with longrange railgun, or carriers that swarm enemy with drones\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warship Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.poster.avif?t=1754408163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.webm?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.mp4?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game progresses, you'll unlock more weapons and dreadnought hulls\u2013 but <i>true power lies in how you assemble them</i>. Every section you choose, every device installed in engineering bay, defines your combat signature. Will your flagship be a glass cannon bristling with spinal-mounted railguns, or an armored leviathan radiating defensive countermeasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The Flagship&quot; is a single-player third-person space warship simulation roguelike game. From destroyers to battleships, freely choose your vessel and equip it to face node-based roguelike challenges, with each adventure offering a different experience. Your ship, equipment, skill level, and roguelike ability build will be constantly tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/72c29218a2610b41ad736a63c5030c32.avif?t=1754408163\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intense and Strategic Space Combat</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.poster.avif?t=1754408163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.webm?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.mp4?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your vessel's loadout, traits, and tactical reflexes will be tested across randomized challenges. Will you prioritize shield capacity or powerful weapons? Sacrifice engine power for more turrets?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelike Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a fresh challenge where you'll unlock unique abilities, customize your warship with upgrades, and ultimately forge a mighty vessel capable of overcoming any threat. Plus, our progression system lets you permanently boost your stats - giving you an increasing edge with each new attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Space Warship Simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.poster.avif?t=1754408163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.webm?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.mp4?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This isn't dogfighting in some tin-can starfighter \u2013 you're commanding capital-class firepower.</i>\u00a0 Unlock warship classes that redefine combat: refitted battleships enhanced with longrange railgun, or carriers that swarm enemy with drones\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warship Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.poster.avif?t=1754408163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.webm?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.mp4?t=1754408163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game progresses, you'll unlock more weapons and dreadnought hulls\u2013 but <i>true power lies in how you assemble them</i>. Every section you choose, every device installed in engineering bay, defines your combat signature. Will your flagship be a glass cannon bristling with spinal-mounted railguns, or an armored leviathan radiating defensive countermeasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
